  "body": "_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_\n\n<details>\n<summary>🧩 Analysis chain</summary>\n\n🏁 Script executed:\n\n```shell\n#!/bin/bash\nrg -n \"useState<CardNumberSegments>|props.value|useEffect|onChange\" src/components/CardNumberSegmentsInput.tsx -C2\nrg -n \"CardNumberSegmentsInput|cardNumberSegments|setFormState\" src/components/CardForm.tsx -C2\n```\n\nRepository: woowacourse/react-payments\n\nLength of output: 1977\n\n---\n\n\n\n</details>\n\n**`value` prop 변경이 내부 상태에 반영되지 않아 controlled 계약이 깨집니다.**\n\n`Line 14`에서 `props.value`를 초기값으로만 사용하고, `Line 16-18`의 `useEffect`는 `props.value` 변경을 감지하지 않습니다. 부모에서 카드 번호를 재설정하거나 폼을 초기화할 때 화면이 최신 상태를 따라가지 못합니다.\n\n해결 방법:\n- `useEffect`에 `[segments, props.value]` 의존성을 추가하고, `props.value` 변경 시 `setSegments(props.value)` 실행\n- 또는 로컬 상태를 제거하고 `props.value`를 직접 사용하는 fully controlled 컴포넌트로 변경\n\n<details>\n<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>\n\n```\nVerify each finding against the current code and only fix it if needed.\n\nIn `@src/components/CardNumberSegmentsInput.tsx` around lines 14 - 18, The\ncomponent CardNumberSegmentsInput currently only initializes segments from\nprops.value and doesn't sync when props.value changes, breaking the controlled\ncontract; update the effect logic around segments and props.onChange so that\nuseEffect depends on [segments, props.value] and when props.value changes call\nsetSegments(props.value) (or alternatively remove local state and read\nprops.value directly to make it fully controlled); ensure you avoid an infinite\nupdate loop by only calling setSegments(props.value) when props.value !==\nsegments (or use an appropriate equality check) and keep\nprops.onChange(segments) triggered only when segments actually change.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- fingerprinting:phantom:poseidon:hawk -->\n\n<!-- 4e71b3a2 -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->",
